 #
 # THE OVERRIDES, and why each one has to differ (docs/project/mister_map.md):
 #   jtcps2_game.v    — the game top: 24-bit qsnd_addr, the profile gate
-#                      instance, wide_en routed to the sound block.
+#                      instance, wide_en routed to the sound block and to the
+#                      SDRAM block, rom0_bank widened to 3 bits (D1 + D2).
 #   jtcps15_sound.v  — the QSound block: 24-bit qsnd_addr and the sample-bank
-#                      latch replaced by the gated jtcps2w_qsnd_bank.
+#                      latch replaced by the gated jtcps2w_qsnd_bank (D1).
+#   jtcps1_sdram.v   — SLICE D2: the bank-0 re-pack, the QSound read split on
+#                      pcm_addr[23], the group-C obj read select, and the two
+#                      new slot counts (7 in bank 0, 2 in bank 1).
+#   jtcps1_prom_we.v — SLICE D2: the DOWNLOAD-side group-C redirect and the
+#                      QSound bank split, both gated by wide_en.
 # THE NEW FILES:
